step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Kangai Mau</col> wants the Rantuki tribe's totem back from <col=800000>Lord Handelmort</col>'s mansion in <col=800000>Ardougne</col>. Perhaps the <col=800000>G.P.D.T.</col> depot in <col=800000>Ardougne</col> has something to do with the Handelmorts.</col>
step	2	2	After relabelling the crate
line	<str>Kangai Mau wants the Rantuki tribe's totem back from Lord Handelmort's mansion in Ardougne.</str>
line	<col=000080>At the <col=800000>G.P.D.T.</col> depot I found the Handelmorts' crate and stuck its address label on <col=800000>Wizard Cromperty</col>'s teleport crate. I should ask <col=800000>Wizard Cromperty</col> about his teleport.</col>
step	3	3	After teleporting into the mansion
line	<str>Kangai Mau wants the Rantuki tribe's totem back from Lord Handelmort's mansion in Ardougne.</str>
line	<str>At the G.P.D.T. depot I found the Handelmorts' crate and stuck its address label on Wizard Cromperty's teleport crate.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Wizard Cromperty</col>'s teleport sent me into <col=800000>Lord Handelmort</col>'s mansion. I should look for the totem, keeping an eye out for traps.</col>
step	4	4	After finding the totem
line	<str>Kangai Mau wants the Rantuki tribe's totem back from Lord Handelmort's mansion in Ardougne.</str>
line	<str>At the G.P.D.T. depot I found the Handelmorts' crate and stuck its address label on Wizard Cromperty's teleport crate.</str>
line	<str>Wizard Cromperty's teleport sent me into Lord Handelmort's mansion.</str>
line	<col=000080>I got through the combination door, past the trapped stairs, and took the <col=800000>Totem</col> from the chest. I should return it to <col=800000>Kangai Mau</col>.</col>
